 "footnotes": [
  {
   "id": "c-eq-11-187",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "书中印的是$[\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j] = \\delta_{ij}$。玻色算符与产生算符的对易式为$\\delta_{ij}$，即$[\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j^\\dagger] = \\delta_{ij}$，与<a href=\"#eq-11-180\">式 (11.180)</a>中的场算符一样；两个湮没算符对易，$[\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j] = 0$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-eq-11-188",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "书中印的是$\\{\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j\\} = \\delta_{ij}$。费米子的关系是$\\{\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j^\\dagger\\} = \\delta_{ij}$，与<a href=\"#eq-11-182\">式 (11.182)</a>相同，并有$\\{\\hat{b}_i, \\hat{b}_j\\} = 0$。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-exact-value",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "书中把 5.8 称为精确值。它是平均场值$3 + 2\\sqrt{2} \\approx 5.83$，<a href=\"#eq-11-211\">式 (11.211)</a>的试探态本身就能达到这个值：它每个格点的能量$-z\\kt|\\langle\\hat{b}_i\\rangle|^2 + \\kUzero\\sin^2\\ktheta/2$，其中$|\\langle\\hat{b}_i\\rangle|^2 = (1 + 1/\\sqrt{2})^2\\sin^2\\ktheta\\cos^2\\ktheta$，一旦$\\kUzero/z\\kt \\geq 2(1 + 1/\\sqrt{2})^2$，其最小值就在$\\ktheta = 0$处。立方格子的量子蒙特卡罗计算给出$\\kUzero/z\\kt \\approx 4.9$（$\\kUzero/\\kt \\approx 29.3$；Capogrosso-Sansone, Prokof'ev and Svistunov, Phys. Rev. B 75, 134302 (2007)）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-nu-dot",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "书中在$\\nu$上印了一个点。所指的是乘积$\\kt\\cdot\\nu$：在平均场中，填充为$\\nu$的莫特相在$\\kUzero/z\\kt = 2\\nu + 1 + 2\\sqrt{\\nu(\\nu + 1)}$处让位，$\\nu = 1$时为 5.83，并按$4\\nu$增长。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-fig-11-15-panel",
   "kind": "correction",
   "figure": "sim-mott-ramp",
   "html": "图注把$20E_r$的图像标为 (g)。膨胀图像从 (a) 到 (h)，$20E_r$的图像是 (h)。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-fig-11-15-year",
   "kind": "correction",
   "figure": "sim-mott-ramp",
   "html": "图注没有给出年份。格赖纳<em>等</em>的“Quantum phase transition from a superfluid to a Mott insulator in a gas of ultracold atoms”于 2002 年发表在 Nature 415, 39。"
  }
