  {
   "id": "mott-transition-estimate",
   "what": "莫特绝缘体到超流体转变的平均场估计",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，11.8 光学格子中的冷原子，11.8.2",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "text": "系统是均匀的：每个格点具有相同的能量$\\kepsi$，到最近邻的跳跃也相同，$\\kt_{i,j} = \\kt$。",
       "src": "11.8.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "态是各格点态的乘积，所以不同格点上算符的期望值等于它们各自期望值的乘积。",
       "src": "(11.205)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\hat{b}_i|\\phi\\rangle_i^\\mathbf{(SF)} = \\kalpha|\\phi\\rangle_i^\\mathbf{(SF)}",
       "src": "(11.170), (11.207)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "|\\kalpha|^2 = 1",
       "src": "(11.207)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_i\\hat{b}_i = \\hat{n}_i(\\hat{n}_i - 1)",
       "src": "(11.190)"
      },
      {
       "text": "$z$是一个格点的最近邻数。",
       "src": "11.8.2"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kH} = \\mk{e}{\\sum_i\\kepsi\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_i} - \\mk{K}{\\sum_{<i,j>}\\kt_{i,j}\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_j} + \\mk{U}{\\frac{\\kUzero}{2}\\sum_i\\hat{n}_i(\\hat{n}_i - 1)}",
      "src": "(11.194)",
      "uses": []
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kH} = \\mk{K}{-\\kt\\sum_{<i,j>}\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_j} + \\mk{U}{\\frac{\\kUzero}{2}\\sum_i\\hat{n}_i(\\hat{n}_i - 1)}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ],
       "cap": "在每个$\\epsilon_i$都相同时，第一项是每个原子的常量能量，将其略去。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{H}{\\kESF} = \\mk{K}{-\\kt\\sum_{j=1}^{z}\\langle\\hat{b}_i^\\dagger\\hat{b}_j\\rangle} + \\mk{U}{\\frac{\\kUzero}{2}\\langle\\hat{n}_i(\\hat{n}_i - 1)\\rangle}",
       "uses": [
        5
       ],
       "cap": "每个格点的能量是单个格点$i$各项的期望值：它的相互作用，以及它到$z$个近邻$j$中每一个的跳跃。"
